    {
      "name": "Forest Passage",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The whiskered renkroda ignores any difficult terrain caused by plants, such as bushes, vines, and undergrowth.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Terrifying Roar",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "auditory",
        "emotion",
        "fear",
        "mental"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The whiskered renkroda bellows ferociously. Each non-renkroda creature within 60 feet must attempt a DC 22 Will Saving Throw save. The creature is then temporarily immune for 10 minutes.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is Frightened 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is Frightened 2.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is Frightened 3.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Upending Charge",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The whiskered renkroda charges forward and slams into its prey. It Strides twice. If the whiskered renkroda ends its movement with an enemy within its reach, it makes a body Strike against that enemy. On a hit, the enemy is knocked Prone.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
